abstract: A database coordination solution, an interface for data input, and a service for making data accessible through generated REST APIs for Maritime Encounters (RJ Program, M21-0018, PI Johan Ling). It has been created and is supported by Gothenburg Research Infrastructure in Digital Humanities (GRIDH).
